  "reviewed_runtime_behavior": "The KCM opens its display and queries XF86VidMode gamma. Without a usable display/gamma API it renders an error state. A metadata/plugin load or that fallback cannot certify successful calibration. A valid functional test must operate an owned virtual X display with a real gamma API and confirm/restores changes.",
